<h3>Matching cabinetry beyond the kitchen</h3>
<p>The fireplace wall in the adjoining family room carries the same Linear oak doors flanking the hearth. Extending the cabinet program out of the kitchen is an upsell that photographs beautifully and almost always gets a "we didn't know we could do that" reaction.</p>

